  "description": "A fully-fledged C# dialect of SQL — a fluent, type-safe query builder for .NET covering every ANSI SQL clause plus SQL Server and MariaDB/MySQL dialects. Produces parameterized SQL strings you execute with Dapper, ADO.NET, or any micro-ORM. Zero boilerplate, injection-safe, 97 unit tests.",
