  "releaseNotes": "v7.0.0-beta01 — Full SQL fluent API: UNION/INTERSECT/EXCEPT, CTEs, CASE WHEN, EXISTS, BETWEEN, IS NULL, paging (ROW_NUMBER, OFFSET/FETCH, LIMIT/OFFSET), all 5 JOIN types, GROUP BY, HAVING, ORDER BY, and parameterization throughout. See https://github.com/nyingimaina/Jattac.Libraries.QBuilder/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md for full details.",
